Given quoted context I assume you're talking about increasing luck
by throwing gems to unicorns. Yes, the main dungeon is appropriate
for that. Or by increasing luck through sacrificing; then you need
a co-aligned altar, which is not guaranteed in the mines.

(It's certainly depending on the actual game what to do first, but
overall my personal preference is Sokoban.)

