Exactly. There's one temple in the mines, and that's it. But it's
a guaranteed altar at least. You don't have that guarantee in the
main dungeon. The next guaranteed altars are in the Valley and in
Orcus' town, though they are unaligned and cannot be converted.
A couple of quests have also altars or temples.

